go/ast/ast.go#295 "IsGenerated reports whether the file was generated by a program,\nnot handwritten, by detecting the special comment described\nat https://go.dev/s/generatedcode.\n\nThe syntax tree must have been parsed with the [go/parser.ParseComments] flag.\nExample:\n\n\tf, err := parser.ParseFile(fset, filename, src, parser.ParseComments|parser.PackageClauseOnly|parser.SkipObjectResolution)\n\tif err != nil { ... }\n\tgen := ast.IsGenerated(f)\n"
  D "P(p<IsGenerated reports whether the file was generated by a program,\nnot handwritten, by detecting the special comment described\nat >a<true,https://go.dev/s/generatedcode;p<https://go.dev/s/generatedcode>>p<.>)P(p<The syntax tree must have been parsed with the >d<go/parser,,ParseComments;p<go/parser.ParseComments>>p< flag.\nExample:>)C(f, err := parser.ParseFile(fset, filename, src, parser.ParseComments|parser.PackageClauseOnly|parser.SkipObjectResolution)\nif err != nil { ... }\ngen := ast.IsGenerated(f)\n)"
