net/url/url.go#2 "Package url parses URLs and implements query escaping.\n\nSee RFC 3986. This package generally follows RFC 3986, except where\nit deviates for compatibility reasons.\nRFC 6874 followed for IPv6 zone literals.\n"
  D "P(p<Package url parses URLs and implements query escaping.>)P(p<See RFC 3986. This package generally follows RFC 3986, except where\nit deviates for compatibility reasons.\nRFC 6874 followed for IPv6 zone literals.>)"
net/url/url.go#3 "When sending changes, first  search old issues for history on decisions.\nUnit tests should also contain references to issue numbers with details.\n"
  D "P(p<When sending changes, first  search old issues for history on decisions.\nUnit tests should also contain references to issue numbers with details.>)"
net/url/url.go#4 "for linkname\n"
  D "P(p<for linkname>)"
